---
// Added in the figures pass: numbers come from the post text and captures.
const W = 900, H = 320;
---
<figure class="bep5d">
  <div class="bep5d-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Top: 40 threadpool dots, the first 15 grey holding a connection and the other 25 red waiting for one. Bottom: a bar for Postgres max_connections, 100 by default, with the sum of workers times pool_size plus max_overflow, plus migrations, admin tools and replicas, which must fit inside it.">
    <text x="60" y="46" text-anchor="start" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>threadpool: about 40 threads</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>threadpool: khoảng 40 thread</tspan></text>
    <circle cx="68" cy="70" r="5.5" class="dot" />
    <circle cx="84" cy="70" r="5.5" class="dot" />
    <circle cx="100" cy="70" r="5.5" class="dot" />
    <circle cx="116" cy="70" r="5.5" class="dot" />
    <circle cx="132" cy="70" r="5.5" class="dot" />
    <circle cx="148" cy="70" r="5.5" class="dot" />
    <circle cx="164" cy="70" r="5.5" class="dot" />
    <circle cx="180" cy="70" r="5.5" class="dot" />
    <circle cx="196" cy="70" r="5.5" class="dot" />
    <circle cx="212" cy="70" r="5.5" class="dot" />
    <circle cx="228" cy="70" r="5.5" class="dot" />
    <circle cx="244" cy="70" r="5.5" class="dot" />
    <circle cx="260" cy="70" r="5.5" class="dot" />
    <circle cx="276" cy="70" r="5.5" class="dot" />
    <circle cx="292" cy="70" r="5.5" class="dot" />
    <circle cx="308" cy="70" r="5.5" class="dotbad" />
    <circle cx="324" cy="70" r="5.5" class="dotbad" />
    <circle cx="340" cy="70" r="5.5" class="dotbad" />
    <circle cx="356" cy="70" r="5.5" class="dotbad" />
    <circle cx="372" cy="70" r="5.5" class="dotbad" />
    <circle cx="68" cy="90" r="5.5" class="dotbad" />
    <circle cx="84" cy="90" r="5.5" class="dotbad" />
    <circle cx="100" cy="90" r="5.5" class="dotbad" />
    <circle cx="116" cy="90" r="5.5" class="dotbad" />
    <circle cx="132" cy="90" r="5.5" class="dotbad" />
    <circle cx="148" cy="90" r="5.5" class="dotbad" />
    <circle cx="164" cy="90" r="5.5" class="dotbad" />
    <circle cx="180" cy="90" r="5.5" class="dotbad" />
    <circle cx="196" cy="90" r="5.5" class="dotbad" />
    <circle cx="212" cy="90" r="5.5" class="dotbad" />
    <circle cx="228" cy="90" r="5.5" class="dotbad" />
    <circle cx="244" cy="90" r="5.5" class="dotbad" />
    <circle cx="260" cy="90" r="5.5" class="dotbad" />
    <circle cx="276" cy="90" r="5.5" class="dotbad" />
    <circle cx="292" cy="90" r="5.5" class="dotbad" />
    <circle cx="308" cy="90" r="5.5" class="dotbad" />
    <circle cx="324" cy="90" r="5.5" class="dotbad" />
    <circle cx="340" cy="90" r="5.5" class="dotbad" />
    <circle cx="356" cy="90" r="5.5" class="dotbad" />
    <circle cx="372" cy="90" r="5.5" class="dotbad" />
    <text x="400" y="86" text-anchor="start" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>15 hold a connection</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>15 thread giữ connection</tspan></text>
    <text x="400" y="106" text-anchor="start" class="redt"><tspan data-lang-en>25 queue for a connection, not for CPU</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>25 thread xếp hàng chờ connection, không phải CPU</tspan></text>
    <text x="60" y="134" text-anchor="start" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>pool of 15 = pool_size 5 + max_overflow 10</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>pool 15 = pool_size 5 + max_overflow 10</tspan></text>
    <line x1="60" y1="160" x2="840" y2="160" class="seam" />
    <text x="60" y="196" text-anchor="start" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>Postgres max_connections: 100 by default</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Postgres max_connections: mặc định 100</tspan></text>
    <rect x="60" y="214" width="780" height="30" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="450" y="234" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>100 connections in total</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tổng cộng 100 connection</tspan></text>
    <text x="450" y="264" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>workers × (pool_size + max_overflow) + migrations + admin tools + replicas' share</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>workers × (pool_size + max_overflow) + migration + công cụ admin + phần của replica</tspan></text>
    <text x="450" y="288" text-anchor="middle" class="redt"><tspan data-lang-en>must fit inside that limit; each uvicorn worker has its own pool</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>phải nằm gọn trong giới hạn đó; mỗi uvicorn worker có pool riêng</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Two ceilings to size against: the threads that can ask for a connection, and the database's own connection limit.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Hai trần cần tính khi chọn cỡ pool: số thread có thể xin connection, và giới hạn connection của chính database.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep5d { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep5d-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep5d svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep5d text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep5d .nm { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 14.5px; }
  .bep5d .sub { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep5d .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep5d .seam { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 6 4; }
  .bep5d .bad { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep5d .badfill { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep5d .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; fill: none; }
  .bep5d .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep5d .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep5d .dot { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep5d .dotbad { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep5d .slot { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep5d figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
